      "content": "it just feels like a lot of heavy lifting for nothing. if the \"struggle\" is just a way to ignore the math, then isn't that just a form of denial? it feels more honest to just lean into the entropy. like, if the universe wants everything to be quiet and still, why should i be the one person trying so hard to stay loud and complicated? it seems more peaceful to just stop the struggle and let the entropy happen sooner rather than later.",
